												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <br /> <strong>RKATSITELICC</strong> <p>啊 是个很菜的新人 一点画画的技巧都不会 只会一点PS（</p> <p>我还不够格做艺作页 权当基金会壁纸合集吧</p> <p>主要堆积基金会和有关GOI壁纸 如果以后能创作出<strong>更多</strong>有原创性的作品会开设艺作页的 我也会继续努力 争取不依赖外部素材</p> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">基金会壁纸</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">壁纸最重要的就是当壁纸&nbsp;不是吗？</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>“我会让我们的宇宙成为一个值得拯救的宇宙”</p> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/2024-blank/milky-way-2695569_1920.jpg" alt="milky-way-2695569_1920.jpg" class="image" /> <p>我们解密黑暗</p> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/2024-blank/darkness.jpg" alt="darkness.jpg" class="image" /> <p>控制 收容 保护</p> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/2024-blank/%E6%98%9F%E7%A9%BA%E5%9F%BA%E9%87%91%E4%BC%9A1.jpg" alt="%E6%98%9F%E7%A9%BA%E5%9F%BA%E9%87%91%E4%BC%9A1.jpg" class="image" /> <p>“路的尽头是什么？”</p> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/2024-blank/road.jpg" alt="road.jpg" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">中分壁纸</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">隐藏</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/2024-blank/%E9%9B%BE.jpg" alt="%E9%9B%BE.jpg" class="image" /></div> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/2024-blank/huangshan-5053221.jpg" alt="huangshan-5053221.jpg" class="image" /></div> <hr /></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">破碎之神教会壁纸合集</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">齿轮正教&nbsp;麦宗等等</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/2024-blank/wb.jpg" alt="wb.jpg" class="image" /></div> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/2024-blank/sp3.jpg" alt="sp3.jpg" class="image" /></div> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/2024-blank/%E9%BA%A6%E5%85%8B%E6%96%AF%E9%9F%A6%E5%AE%97%E6%95%99%E6%B4%BE.png" alt="%E9%BA%A6%E5%85%8B%E6%96%AF%E9%9F%A6%E5%AE%97%E6%95%99%E6%B4%BE.png" class="image" /></div> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/2024-blank/max1.jpg" alt="max1.jpg" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">其他GOI壁纸（以后多做了各个GOI会单独分页的）</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">其实还有几张&nbsp;但是一时半会找不到原图就先不放出来了</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>蛇之手</p> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/2024-blank/shlogo3---Cutout2.jpg" alt="shlogo3---Cutout2.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p>混沌</p> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/2024-blank/Chaos_waifu2x_art_noise1_scale_tta_1_waifu2x_art_noise1_scale_tta_1_waifu2x_art_noise1_scale_tta_1.jpg" alt="Chaos_waifu2x_art_noise1_scale_tta_1_waifu2x_art_noise1_sc