80%85.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E4%BA%BA%E9%A1%9E%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>人类学家</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上的、具自我的，外貌近似人类的，人型生物项目的SCP文档</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>生物学家</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上的、包含下列任一标签的SCP文档：生物性、活物、基因、动物、植物、细菌</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%BF%83%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%BF%83%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>心理学家</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上的、包含下列任一标签的SCP文档：精神影响、模因、强迫性、移情作用、记忆影响、知识</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%B4%A9%E5%A3%8A%E3%81%AE%E3%81%8D%E3%81%A3%E3%81%8B%E3%81%91.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%B4%A9%E5%A3%8A%E3%81%AE%E3%81%8D%E3%81%A3%E3%81%8B%E3%81%91.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>崩坏的契机</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上、包含K级情景标签的SCP文档</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E7%A7%A9%E5%BA%8F%E3%82%92%E5%AE%88%E3%82%8B%E6%82%AA%E9%AD%94.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E7%A7%A9%E5%BA%8F%E3%82%92%E5%AE%88%E3%82%8B%E6%82%AA%E9%AD%94.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>守护秩序的恶魔</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上、关于Thaumiel级项目的SCP文档</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%82%B7%E3%83%B3%E3%83%97%E3%83%AB%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BA%E3%83%99%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%82%B7%E3%83%B3%E3%83%97%E3%83%AB%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BA%E3%83%99%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>简单的就是最好的</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇通常格式的且不包含附录、录音、实验记录、访谈记录、探索记录等的SCP文章，并得到20以上的评分</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%BF%E3%82%93%E3%81%AA%E3%81%A7%E3%81%A4%E3%81%8F%E3%82%8D%E3%81%86.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%81%BF%E3%82%93%E3%81%AA%E3%81%A7%E3%81%A4%E3%81%8F%E3%82%8D%E3%81%86.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>大家一起来</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇合作文档</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="right-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%80%B1%E5%88%8A%E8%AA%8C.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E9%80%B1%E5%88%8A%E8%AA%8C.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>周刊杂志</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>一个月内发布4篇以上的文档</strong></span></p> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-4" style="display:none"> <p><a href="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/zhanwudazhan">站务大战</a></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-5" style="display:none"></div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-6" style="display:none"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-world-turned-into-a-warm-water-harbor">世界化为不冻港</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/third-gulf-war">第三次海湾战争后记</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/baydian-1">阿拉伯机械帝国史</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sharkypedia-eoyemlau">游音流-鲨击百科</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/hushless">请勿缄默</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/grant-request-for-technical-movements">批准研发新型技术动作及其辅助套装以缓和卫生间远红外热波浴霸超常规辐射效应的申请</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:light-pollution">光污染</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/concerto">非穷举众议联合ರೃ《协奏曲计划公开》</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/a-story-from-the-past">德尔塔指挥部 “双子帷幕”重要指示记录</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1364">SCP-CN-1364“欲加之惧”</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-first-starourenk-retreat">第一次斯達歐倫克撤退戰</a></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-7" style="display:none"> <hr /> <h1><span><strong>待删除：</strong></span></h1> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scotoma" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3929032&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609099644" alt="Scotoma" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3929032)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scotoma" >Scotoma</a></span></p> 
